WEBVTT

00:05.580 --> 00:09.470
It’s slow going, but I’m starting to gain confidence.

00:09.470 --> 00:12.200
I want to get better quickly!

00:12.200 --> 00:14.560
Better and better!

00:14.560 --> 00:18.930
I want to give Ayako the best Christmas ever!

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

01:50.000 --> 01:55.010
Beatrice Christmas

02:06.800 --> 02:08.150
Mamo—

02:17.900 --> 02:20.280
I-I’m fine now.

02:20.280 --> 02:21.900
Let’s keep going.

02:21.900 --> 02:23.200
Here.

02:24.790 --> 02:26.760
You rest, Emelenzia.

02:26.760 --> 02:28.260
I’ll try it myself.

02:43.300 --> 02:46.790
<i>I thought his height wasn’t so different from mine,</i>

02:46.790 --> 02:49.450
<i>but I guess gentlemen are...</i>

02:51.230 --> 02:52.730
<i>This can’t be happening.</i>

02:52.740 --> 02:55.150
Iron Laws of Love, Article 621
“I can’t go back now... A sweet seduction...
I’m embarrassed, but I’ll do it anyway!”

02:55.150 --> 02:58.470
I followed the book and took a bath.
And since last night,

02:58.470 --> 03:01.430
I haven’t eaten any strong-smelling foods.

03:02.580 --> 03:04.000
But... But...

03:10.600 --> 03:12.170
Just a bit more.

03:12.910 --> 03:14.620
Are you OK?

03:14.620 --> 03:15.880
Yeah.

03:16.640 --> 03:18.010
H-Huh?

03:21.860 --> 03:23.470
Yoshimura Mamoru?

03:32.570 --> 03:33.480
Ayako-san!

03:35.650 --> 03:37.470
You’re still here?

03:38.630 --> 03:40.900
Don’t go near her!

03:42.640 --> 03:44.120
Look!

03:47.070 --> 03:48.320
A radar?

03:48.320 --> 03:50.880
Years of experience tell me

03:50.880 --> 03:54.460
that we’ll get hurt if we’re
too close to her now.

04:01.850 --> 04:03.380
Thanks.

04:06.460 --> 04:10.170
If you’re tired, don’t hold back. Tell me.

04:10.170 --> 04:11.520
Thanks.

04:11.520 --> 04:13.770
I thought it was odd.

04:13.770 --> 04:16.670
You’re still unused to Beatrice Control,

04:16.670 --> 04:19.730
but you succeeded in holding
your concentration for that long...

04:19.730 --> 04:23.780
I wanted to make sure I got
good grades on these exams.

04:24.300 --> 04:26.650
I want Ayako-san to accept my ability.

04:28.450 --> 04:30.790
During the ski trip...

04:31.050 --> 04:36.620
I just slowed her down and endangered her.

04:37.660 --> 04:42.850
I’m truly sorry for that.

04:42.850 --> 04:45.290
No, that’s not what I meant.

04:45.290 --> 04:47.600
I’m not blaming you.

04:48.020 --> 04:51.350
But I want the self-confidence

04:51.350 --> 04:55.020
to know I’m worthy to stand beside her.

05:08.950 --> 05:12.420
You’re working hard, Emelenzia.

05:12.420 --> 05:13.970
Brother!

05:16.290 --> 05:17.560
Good.

05:17.560 --> 05:18.440
Continue.

05:18.440 --> 05:19.380
Right!

05:24.090 --> 05:27.550
You’ve been doing that since
Witch Beatrice left for Japan.

05:28.990 --> 05:31.980
Do you want her to accept you as an equal?

05:34.050 --> 05:35.470
No!

05:35.470 --> 05:37.840
She has nothing to do with it!

05:37.840 --> 05:41.360
I want to be useful to you.

05:41.360 --> 05:43.070
Yes, I’m counting on you.

05:48.140 --> 05:49.610
You’re the same as me.

05:54.910 --> 05:56.520
Are you still tired?

05:56.520 --> 05:59.250
No, I’m fine.

06:00.230 --> 06:02.170
I’m pretty tough.

06:02.170 --> 06:04.050
I’ll train you for real.

06:05.620 --> 06:06.910
Thank you.

06:11.600 --> 06:13.390
What’s wrong?

06:13.390 --> 06:14.140
Napping out of spite?

06:14.650 --> 06:15.530
W-Wait!

06:15.530 --> 06:16.480
Wait, wait, wait!

06:16.480 --> 06:19.150
If you want to live long,
you should get out of here.

06:19.660 --> 06:22.560
Did you fight with Mamoru-kun?

06:24.030 --> 06:26.310
I didn’t.

06:26.310 --> 06:29.080
Emelenzia’s taking advantage of how

06:29.080 --> 06:32.120
nice and introverted he is, to cling onto him!

06:32.120 --> 06:33.980
Wearing a frilly negligee...

06:33.980 --> 06:36.210
She’s in love with her brother. What’s she doing?

06:37.410 --> 06:38.810
I see.

06:40.500 --> 06:45.160
The sweater you made must be pretty warm.

06:46.050 --> 06:47.880
What are you saying?

06:56.210 --> 06:59.910
Ayako, sewing a sweater without telling Mamoru-kun.

06:59.910 --> 07:03.860
Mamoru-kun, practicing beatrice without telling Ayako.

07:05.670 --> 07:07.190
Awful, huh?

07:12.070 --> 07:13.590
You have thirty minutes!

07:13.590 --> 07:14.310
Start!

07:26.130 --> 07:28.390
#20, Watanabe Takayuki!

07:28.390 --> 07:29.340
Here.

07:37.490 --> 07:38.350
That’s enough.

07:38.350 --> 07:39.040
Next!

07:40.400 --> 07:42.940
#21, Yoshimura Mamoru!

07:42.940 --> 07:44.390
Right!

07:44.390 --> 07:46.480
Top-Ranking Students

07:46.480 --> 07:48.760
Seriously?

07:48.760 --> 07:49.530
Don’t look!

07:49.530 --> 07:50.610
Don’t look at me.

07:51.050 --> 07:53.860
#21... #21...

07:54.540 --> 07:58.640
Yoshimura Mamoru

07:58.640 --> 08:00.110
Written Exam: 78
Practical Exam: D

08:00.900 --> 08:03.960
Your practical wasn’t very good.

08:06.040 --> 08:08.180
Ayako-san!

08:08.180 --> 08:09.380
Mamoru...

08:12.930 --> 08:14.150
Um...

08:14.150 --> 08:15.380
Ayako-san?

08:15.380 --> 08:17.100
See you later!

08:17.910 --> 08:19.910
Yoshimura Mamoru?

08:19.910 --> 08:22.560
Maybe I disappointed her...

08:31.280 --> 08:36.430
<i>He worked so hard, yet the
beatrice doesn’t accept him...</i>

08:37.000 --> 08:40.920
<i>Today, maybe I should go easy on him.</i>

08:42.730 --> 08:44.980
<i>No! No pity!</i>

08:46.420 --> 08:49.500
<i>Beatrice practice is over.</i>

08:49.500 --> 08:53.150
<i>Now I must hit hard, from the front!</i>

08:53.150 --> 08:55.170
<i>I need to seduce Yoshimura Mamoru...</i>

08:55.170 --> 08:56.210
Hey!

08:57.080 --> 08:58.940
We’re preparing for the party.

08:58.940 --> 09:00.220
Come on.

09:00.220 --> 09:01.950
The party?

09:01.950 --> 09:06.800
Um, the President made a secret
deal with the principal...

09:06.800 --> 09:08.290
No!

09:08.290 --> 09:12.320
He asked if we could use the school!

09:19.180 --> 09:21.080
<i>Santa Claus is my boyfriend...</i>

09:21.080 --> 09:25.080
That’s right... Ayako-san’s Santa
is me, Abiko Tsuneo!

09:31.220 --> 09:34.120
I ignored exams to work
every part-time job I could.

09:32.250 --> 09:34.120
Mamoru, you’re very funny.

09:34.120 --> 09:36.930
And then, I bought all the presents I could.

09:39.010 --> 09:44.420
This is a love bomb, filled with my love for Ayako-san!

09:44.420 --> 09:47.440
On this holy night, I’m burning for Ayako-san!

09:47.440 --> 09:49.680
Sparking!

09:49.680 --> 09:51.520
Hey, you! Stop right there.

09:52.530 --> 09:54.870
What were you saying about a bomb?

09:54.870 --> 09:56.240
Would you show us what you have there?

09:56.870 --> 10:00.240
Wh-What right do you have to stop my progress?

10:00.650 --> 10:05.050
Are you the school reindeer,
rather than its guard dog?

10:05.050 --> 10:06.500
<i>Wh-What’s with him?</i>

10:06.500 --> 10:11.100
And how can you be a security guard at East-B,

10:11.100 --> 10:14.920
but not know who I am?

10:18.600 --> 10:22.970
Oh, my god!

10:31.080 --> 10:33.060
This is kind of fun.

10:33.060 --> 10:37.240
Yeah... We can have our Christmas
at night, in the school!

10:37.240 --> 10:41.200
And we can take a tree from
the courtyard to decorate...

10:41.200 --> 10:45.530
<i>Snow Kong Kong, Hallelujah Kong Kong.</i>

10:41.200 --> 10:42.830
It’s so romanti—

10:45.530 --> 10:49.250
<i>It just keeps coming down and never stops.</i>

10:49.690 --> 10:52.610
It’s not romantic at all.

10:52.610 --> 10:53.600
Yeah.

10:53.600 --> 10:55.920
Well, whatever...

10:57.340 --> 10:58.630
Oh, Ayako!

11:00.260 --> 11:03.130
Where are Mamoru and Emelenzia?

11:04.420 --> 11:08.070
They’re making food in the Home Ec. Room.

11:08.680 --> 11:13.560
They’re preparing some kind of traditional
German Christmas dish for us.

11:13.560 --> 11:17.570
Pretending to know nothing

11:26.380 --> 11:27.360
I think...

11:27.360 --> 11:30.460
I feel like a storm’s approaching.

11:33.740 --> 11:35.900
Like this?

11:35.900 --> 11:37.720
That’s dangerous.

11:37.720 --> 11:40.220
You’ll cut your hand.

11:40.220 --> 11:43.790
You keep your left hand at the base.

11:44.940 --> 11:47.930
You’re good at cooking, too, huh?

11:47.930 --> 11:48.970
Too?

11:48.970 --> 11:52.370
Ayako-san’s really good, as well!

11:54.150 --> 11:55.710
The base, right?

11:55.710 --> 11:56.940
I’ll try.

11:56.940 --> 11:57.730
Um...

11:57.730 --> 12:01.100
No, like this...

12:01.660 --> 12:03.060
Ayako?

12:03.060 --> 12:04.820
You’re not going in?

12:08.190 --> 12:09.980
What is this?

12:09.980 --> 12:11.880
Mamoru-san and Emelenzia!

12:11.880 --> 12:14.000
You look all lovey-dovey!

12:14.000 --> 12:15.220
No...

12:15.890 --> 12:18.880
I wish we were...

12:18.880 --> 12:19.580
Yeah?

12:19.580 --> 12:22.030
I think she just said something important...

12:25.900 --> 12:29.590
I must have misheard it.

12:29.590 --> 12:35.720
I haven’t cleaned my ears in two days.

12:35.720 --> 12:37.920
Two days is fine.

12:37.920 --> 12:40.440
It actually isn’t good to do too much.

12:40.440 --> 12:42.890
No, that’s not the problem.

12:44.030 --> 12:47.490
I want to be love-love-y with Yoshimura Mamoru.

12:52.370 --> 12:53.720
Ayako-san!

14:08.440 --> 14:10.100
Listen to me, Ayako-san!

14:11.360 --> 14:12.280
No!

14:12.280 --> 14:13.800
Ayako-san!

14:13.800 --> 14:15.560
You...

14:18.090 --> 14:22.070
I thought you, and you alone,
would always be on my side,

14:22.070 --> 14:23.840
no matter what...

14:27.630 --> 14:30.880
That you’d never lie.

14:30.880 --> 14:34.180
That you’d never leave me.

14:34.590 --> 14:37.230
That you, alone, wouldn’t...

14:37.230 --> 14:39.570
Ayako-san...

14:46.410 --> 14:51.280
No... I look so stupid.

14:57.840 --> 15:00.020
Mamo—

15:00.020 --> 15:05.920
Ayako... I asked Emelenzia to
teach me Beatrice Control.

15:08.380 --> 15:11.510
I want you to accept my ability.

15:11.510 --> 15:16.290
I want to protect you, not just let you protect me.

15:27.910 --> 15:31.250
Because I love you.

15:35.530 --> 15:39.170
Well, my exam was a disaster.

15:40.780 --> 15:42.330
Show me.

15:42.690 --> 15:45.400
Show me what you learned in your training.

15:47.940 --> 15:49.460
Right!

16:27.590 --> 16:29.440
That was so pretty.

16:31.980 --> 16:34.880
This is all I can do.

16:34.880 --> 16:39.060
It’s like those cherry blossoms that day.

16:41.080 --> 16:46.340
It’s only been a few months
since then, but you know...

16:49.110 --> 16:52.950
I was a little scared.

16:53.890 --> 16:55.810
Falling in love at first sight...

16:55.810 --> 16:59.570
No, loving someone this much at all...

16:59.570 --> 17:01.160
It hadn’t ever happened to me before.

17:01.160 --> 17:06.340
I was sure I’d never have a
greater amount of love.

17:06.340 --> 17:07.890
Ayako-san...

17:08.780 --> 17:11.170
But I was wrong.

17:11.910 --> 17:14.610
There was more.

17:17.510 --> 17:22.180
I love you more and more...

17:22.180 --> 17:26.350
I can’t stop it. It just
keeps coming, and I’m scared.

17:26.350 --> 17:29.060
Yes, I was scared.

17:32.400 --> 17:34.770
I was scared, too.

17:35.740 --> 17:41.400
I was scared of being unworthy of your love.

17:41.400 --> 17:44.770
I wanted to get close to you quickly...

17:47.310 --> 17:51.800
But I’m sure I was wrong.

17:51.800 --> 17:54.590
I should have taken my time.

17:56.750 --> 17:58.430
Yes, that’s right.

18:00.070 --> 18:02.140
It doesn’t have to be fast.

18:02.140 --> 18:03.420
Slow...

18:04.550 --> 18:08.270
Yes, let’s take our time.

18:43.770 --> 18:46.680
Mamoru, will you say it to me again?

18:59.720 --> 19:03.410
Ayako-san, I love you.

19:04.430 --> 19:06.200
Once more.

19:06.200 --> 19:08.120
I love you.

19:09.170 --> 19:10.620
Once more.

19:10.620 --> 19:13.090
I love you...

19:19.760 --> 19:24.300
<i>I decided my first kiss would be romantic,</i>

19:24.300 --> 19:26.180
<i>by the sea, with a setting sun...</i>

19:33.180 --> 19:35.770
Looks like they got back together.

19:35.770 --> 19:38.370
It’s so wonderful!

19:38.370 --> 19:40.990
They’re the best Christmas lights ever.

19:40.990 --> 19:45.780
It’s a rather beautiful use of Ayako’s beatrice.

19:49.120 --> 19:50.540
<i>No.</i>

19:50.540 --> 19:53.570
<i>It’s not just Witch Beatrice.</i>

19:53.570 --> 19:58.300
<i>I can feel Yoshimura Mamoru there, too.</i>

19:59.010 --> 20:04.350
<i>Yoshimura Mamoru’s beatrice ability
wasn’t supposed to be so high.</i>

20:04.350 --> 20:06.350
<i>Was I wrong?</i>

20:07.660 --> 20:09.130
<i>But why?</i>

20:12.520 --> 20:15.360
Merry Christmas...

20:15.360 --> 20:16.590
Ayako-san.

20:23.130 --> 20:25.160
Merry Christmas...

20:33.260 --> 20:36.280
See you next year! — The staff

20:37.800 --> 20:41.270
Merry Christmas to every window.

20:50.910 --> 20:52.430
My brother?

20:54.570 --> 20:57.770
Merry Christmas to everyone.

20:58.540 --> 21:00.690
Merry Christmas.

21:20.000 --> 21:22.880
Merry Christmas, Ayako.

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:15.690 --> 23:19.330
The Witch Beatrice is very family-oriented.

23:19.330 --> 23:23.190
First thing in the morning, she carefully combs through the coupon books.

23:23.190 --> 23:26.390
“Tamagoyaki are an important part of a boxed lunch,” she says.

23:26.390 --> 23:30.310
“This place has eggs 36 yen cheaper!”

23:30.310 --> 23:33.170
“But they might not be as fresh...”

23:33.170 --> 23:36.060
She goes on for thirty minutes like that.

23:36.060 --> 23:38.980
Oh, keep this a secret!

23:38.980 --> 23:43.980
The Demon King Appears!

23:39.800 --> 23:42.260
Next time: The Demon King Appears.
